# Four equinoxes — living identity: direction · element · day-quarter · angular house + flanks
# Seated Keaton's word 20260730.082536 (Equinox Map Correction Journey).
# Sign-ward labels are optional mood gloss only; they must not contradict this table.
# Flank path uses -> (walk around the cusp). Not < (fights arithmetic) and not >> (bitshift).
