equinox 2 north water noon house_10 flanks 11th->10th->9th e64-e127
equinox 3 west air dusk house_7 flanks 8th->7th->6th e128-e191
equinox 4 south earth midnight house_4 flanks 5th->4th->3rd e192-e255
